subckt dut (VDD VSS GND Vout\+ VBP2 VBN2 Vout\- VBN1 VBP1 VCM Vin\+ Vin\- PHIA PHIA_bar)
subckt ideal_switch (p n cp cn)
parameters ron=1 roff=1e12 vt=0.5
core (p n) bsource i=v(p,n)/(v(cp,cn)>vt ? ron : roff)
ends ideal_switch
C1 (VDDP VSSP) capacitor c=1p
C2 (VDDP net17) capacitor c=1p
C3 (VSSP net19) capacitor c=1p
